(N'5.15', N'5.15.10', N'Ensure that privileged access accounts are subject to enhanced monitoring, logging, and periodic review.', N'Privileged access accounts are subject to enhanced monitoring, logging, and periodic review. Assign an owner, follow the activity consistently, review it when required, and keep suitable evidence.', N'Ensure privileged access accounts are subject to enhanced monitoring, logging, and periodic review, review access regularly, and remove it when no longer needed.'),
(N'5.15', N'5.15.11', N'Ensure that dormant, inactive, or unused accounts are identified and disabled or removed after a defined period of inactivity.', N'Dormant, inactive, or unused accounts are identified and disabled or removed after a defined period of inactivity. Assign an owner, follow the activity consistently, review it when required, and keep suitable evidence.', N'Ensure dormant, inactive, or unused accounts are identified and disabled or removed after a defined period of inactivity, review access regularly, and remove it when no longer needed.'),
(N'5.15', N'5.15.12', N'User access rights are periodically recertified by system owners or managers to confirm ongoing business justification.', N'User access rights are periodically recertified by system owners or managers to confirm ongoing business justification. Assign an owner, follow the activity consistently, review it when required, and keep suitable evidence.', N'User access rights are periodically recertified by system owners or managers to confirm ongoing business justification, review access regularly, and remove it when no longer needed.'),
(N'5.15', N'5.15.13', N'Ensure that remote access permissions are granted only where business justified and are subject to additional security controls such as Multi-Factor Authentication.', N'Remote access permissions are granted only where business justified and are subject to additional security controls such as Multi-Factor Authentication. Assign an owner, follow the activity consistently, review it when required, and keep suitable evidence.', N'Ensure remote access permissions are granted only where business justified and are subject to additional security controls such as Multi-Factor Authentication, review access regularly, and remove it when no longer needed.'),
