(N'8.9', N'8.9.7', N'Ensure that you use automated tools to monitor "Configuration Drift"-when a system''s settings move away from the "Master Build.".', N'You use automated tools to monitor "Configuration Drift"-when a system''s settings move away from the "Master Build.". Assign an owner, follow the activity consistently, review it when required, and keep suitable evidence.', N'Ensure you use automated tools to monitor "Configuration Drift"-when a system''s settings move away from the "Master Build.", monitor results, record actions, and track closure.'),
(N'8.9', N'8.9.8', N'Ensure that you perform a "Configuration Audit" at least once a year to ensure your master templates are still following the latest security advice.', N'You perform a "Configuration Audit" at least once a year to ensure your master templates are still following the latest security advice. Assign an owner, follow the activity consistently, review it when required, and keep suitable evidence.', N'Ensure you perform a "Configuration Audit" at least once a year to ensure your master templates are still following the latest security advice, assign an owner, follow it consistently, and keep suitable evidence.'),
(N'8.9', N'8.9.9', N'Ensure that an "Asset Tag" or "Configuration ID" is assigned to every system to link it to its specific setup history.', N'An "Asset Tag" or "Configuration ID" is assigned to every system to link it to its specific setup history. Assign an owner, follow the activity consistently, review it when required, and keep suitable evidence.', N'Ensure an "Asset Tag" or "Configuration ID" is assigned to every system to link it to its specific setup history, keep records updated, and review ownership or status regularly.'),
(N'8.9', N'8.9.10', N'Ensure that before a configuration change is pushed to everyone, it is tested in a "Sandbox" environment to ensure it won''t crash the business.', N'Before a configuration change is pushed to everyone, it is tested in a "Sandbox" environment to ensure it won''t crash the business. Assign an owner, follow the activity consistently, review it when required, and keep suitable evidence.', N'Ensure before a configuration change is pushed to everyone, it is tested in a "Sandbox" environment to ensure it won''t crash the business, include it in project or change controls, and keep approval or test evidence.'),
(N'8.9', N'8.9.11', N'Approved secure configuration standards are documented for servers, endpoints, databases, network devices, and cloud services.', N'Approved secure configuration standards are documented for servers, endpoints, databases, network devices, and cloud services. Assign an owner, follow the activity consistently, review it when required, and keep suitable evidence.', N'Approved secure configuration standards are documented for servers, endpoints, databases, network devices, and cloud services, keep records updated, and review ownership or status regularly.'),
(N'8.9', N'8.9.12', N'Ensure that emergency configuration changes follow an expedited approval process and are reviewed afterward.', N'Emergency configuration changes follow an expedited approval process and are reviewed afterward. Assign an owner, follow the activity consistently, review it when required, and keep suitable evidence.', N'Ensure emergency configuration changes follow an expedited approval process and are reviewed afterward, include it in project or change controls, and keep approval or test evidence.'),
(N'8.9', N'8.9.13', N'Ensure that production, test, and development environments maintain separate configuration baselines.', N'Production, test, and development environments maintain separate configuration baselines. Assign an owner, follow the activity consistently, review it when required, and keep suitable evidence.', N'Ensure production, test, and development environments maintain separate configuration baselines, include it in project or change controls, and keep approval or test evidence.'),
